              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “the people who are living in the ruined cities of the land of Israel are saying: ‘Abraham was only one man, and he was given the whole land. There are many of us, so now the land is ours.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tell them what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying: You eat meat with the blood still in it. You worship idols. You commit murder. What makes you think that the land belongs to you? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You rely on your swords. Your actions are disgusting. Everyone commits adultery. What makes you think that the land is yours?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tell them that I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", warn them that as surely as I am the living God, the people who live in the ruined cities will be killed. Those living in the country will be eaten by wild animals. Those hiding in the mountains and in caves will die of disease. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make the country a desolate waste, and the power they were so proud of will come to an end. The mountains of Israel will be so wild that no one will be able to travel through them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I punish the people for their sins and make the country a waste, then they will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Mortal man, your people are talking about you when they meet by the city walls or in the doorways of their houses. They say to one another, ‘Let's go and hear what word has come from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " now.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So my people crowd in to hear what you have to say, but they don't do what you tell them to do. Loving words are on their lips, but they continue their greedy ways. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To them you are nothing more than an entertainer singing love songs or playing a harp. They listen to all your words and don't obey a single one of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when all your words come true — and they will come true — then they will know that a prophet has been among them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
